  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Breaking Changes\n* Removed .NET 8 and .NET 9 TFMs ahead of .NET 8 & 9 EOL - .NET 8 and .NET 9 remain supported via .NET Standard 2.0 TFM with limited support - Update to .NET 10 or newer for full support\n* Moved ``DotExtensions.MsExtensions.StringSegments`` namespace to ``DotExtensions.MsExtensions.Primitives``\n* Moved ``DotExtensions.MsExtensions.StringValuePlural`` namespace to ``DotExtensions.MsExtensions.Primitives``\n* Removed ``ToUnixDateString`` extension method\n* Removed Task ``Wait(bool, CancellationToken)`` and ``Wait(bool)`` non async methods\n* Renamed ``DayOfWeekInt`` extension method to ``CalculateDayOfWeekAsInteger``\n* Changed ``WeekOfMonth`` extension method to be an extension property\n* Renamed ``DaysInYear`` extension method to ``CalculateNumberOfDaysInYear``\n* Removed additional deprecated code\n\n### Non-Breaking Changes\n* Optimisations and performance improvements\n* Moved more exception messages to Resources resx file\n* Reworked ``GetRandomDrive`` static extension method to add optional parameter\n* Updated internal Polyfill version to 9.13.0\n* Improves robustness of string and StringSegment Capitalization extensions\n* Added some missing xml doc comments\n* Improved helpfulness of some thrown exceptions",
